WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.430 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.340 --> 01:37.870
[Episode 31]

4
01:38.759 --> 01:41.289
I seemed to hear someone shouting in my dream,

5
01:41.430 --> 01:42.590
"We have boats!"

6
01:43.680 --> 01:44.789
In my dream,

7
01:45.759 --> 01:46.890
I also heard someone shouting.

8
01:46.890 --> 01:49.289
I think I heard it in my dream too.

9
01:49.710 --> 01:51.640
Four people having the same dream.

10
01:54.150 --> 01:55.310
Is that possible?

11
02:00.000 --> 02:01.310
We have boats!

12
02:02.510 --> 02:03.840
We have boats!

13
02:05.400 --> 02:06.860
Are we still dreaming now?

14
02:09.150 --> 02:11.140
We have boats! We have boats!

15
02:15.870 --> 02:17.750
Leaders, a telegram from Chief of Staff Bocheng!

16
02:17.750 --> 02:18.430
Read it!

17
02:19.079 --> 02:20.630
There are six boats at Jiaoping Ferry.

18
02:20.630 --> 02:21.820
10,000 people can cross per day.

19
02:21.820 --> 02:23.910
[Wang Zheng, Director of the Third Bureau of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

20
02:22.000 --> 02:25.660
The Military Commission Column can finish crossing in five days!

21
02:29.680 --> 02:30.310
I propose

22
02:30.630 --> 02:32.200
to immediately establish a River Crossing Command,

23
02:32.200 --> 02:33.630
with Comrade Bocheng as Commander

24
02:33.630 --> 02:35.560
and Comrade Chen Yun as Political Commissar,

25
02:35.560 --> 02:37.400
to unify the command of the Military Commission Column's crossing.

26
02:37.400 --> 02:37.800
Good.

27
02:37.800 --> 02:41.910
We have boats!

28
02:42.710 --> 02:45.040
This is exactly what I dreamed of just now.

29
02:46.590 --> 02:48.860
We have boats! We have boats!

30
02:49.030 --> 02:52.680
We have boats! We have boats!

31
02:53.280 --> 02:56.800
We have boats! We have boats!

32
02:57.000 --> 02:59.910
We have boats! We have boats!

33
03:00.280 --> 03:03.520
We have boats! We have boats!

34
03:07.630 --> 03:11.120
We have boats! We have boats! We have boats!

35
03:30.390 --> 03:31.730
Write the marks clearly

36
03:32.030 --> 03:33.740
so it's convenient for our comrades to board.

37
03:33.740 --> 03:34.550
Yes.

38
04:20.820 --> 04:24.560
[Rules of Crossing the River]

39
04:44.380 --> 04:45.970
Chaoshou, Chaoshou.

40
04:46.480 --> 04:48.240
They really feed us,

41
04:48.750 --> 04:49.750
and pay us in cash?

42
04:50.630 --> 04:51.890
How could that be fake?

43
04:53.360 --> 04:54.040
See this?

44
04:54.770 --> 04:56.770
The Red Army gave it to me last night.

45
04:57.080 --> 04:58.280
They keep their word.

46
04:59.860 --> 05:00.950
Really?

47
05:01.390 --> 05:02.600
I'd say this is great.

48
05:03.000 --> 05:03.560
The tax bureau,

49
05:03.560 --> 05:04.760
and the Tusi village,

50
05:05.120 --> 05:06.480
when they asked us to row the boat,

51
05:06.480 --> 05:07.610
did they ever pay us?

52
05:07.720 --> 05:08.630
Yeah.

53
05:10.890 --> 05:12.090
Water, water, water.

54
05:13.640 --> 05:15.040
I still don't quite believe it.

55
05:15.040 --> 05:15.800
Chaoshou,

56
05:16.160 --> 05:17.690
you must have been tricked.

57
05:17.880 --> 05:18.750
If you ask me,

58
05:18.880 --> 05:20.320
after we ferry them over,

59
05:20.700 --> 05:21.960
the money they gave you

60
05:22.210 --> 05:23.940
will definitely be taken back.

61
05:25.040 --> 05:26.370
Anyway, I believe them.

62
05:26.880 --> 05:28.210
I saw it with my own eyes.

63
05:28.390 --> 05:29.850
They locked up Master Lin.

64
05:30.130 --> 05:32.070
Those militia bosses who usually scold us

65
05:32.070 --> 05:33.560
and beat us for no reason,

66
05:34.390 --> 05:35.850
when they saw the Red Army,

67
05:36.390 --> 05:37.720
wet their pants in fear.

68
05:39.100 --> 05:40.430
Exactly.

69
05:41.240 --> 05:43.240
Fellow villagers, it's time to eat!

70
05:43.560 --> 05:44.430
Time to eat.

71
05:44.680 --> 05:45.560
Time to eat.

72
05:49.430 --> 05:49.870
This is...

73
05:49.870 --> 05:51.159
Thanks for your hard work.

74
05:51.159 --> 05:52.360
Here, bowls and chopsticks.

75
05:52.360 --> 05:52.830
Quick.

76
05:53.800 --> 05:54.750
Let's eat.

77
05:57.070 --> 05:58.090
Eat while it's hot.

78
05:58.090 --> 06:00.020
Let me serve the meat for everyone.

79
06:00.360 --> 06:01.240
And the rice.

80
06:02.270 --> 06:03.880
Uncle, thanks for your hard work.

81
06:03.880 --> 06:04.710
You eat first.

82
06:05.130 --> 06:07.400
[Chen Yun, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee and Director of the Central White Areas Work Department]

83
06:06.050 --> 06:07.120
Here, give it to me.

84
06:08.750 --> 06:09.640
It's still hot.

85
06:09.790 --> 06:11.120
Here, help yourselves.

86
06:11.380 --> 06:12.310
We'll do it ourselves.

87
06:12.310 --> 06:13.570
We'll do it ourselves.

88
06:13.950 --> 06:15.240
Food is served over there too.

89
06:15.240 --> 06:16.120
I have to go eat.

90
06:16.430 --> 06:18.160
Take your time, everyone. Eat slowly.

91
06:18.160 --> 06:19.220
If it's not enough,

92
06:19.240 --> 06:20.360
come find me and tell me.

93
06:20.360 --> 06:21.630
I'll make more for everyone.

94
06:21.630 --> 06:22.630
Okay, okay, okay.

95
06:23.320 --> 06:24.330
Fellow villagers,

96
06:24.330 --> 06:25.480
let me say a few words.

97
06:25.480 --> 06:26.510
Take your time, everyone.

98
06:26.510 --> 06:27.430
Eat slowly.

99
06:27.450 --> 06:28.630
The leader told me,

100
06:28.710 --> 06:29.830
today's meal,

101
06:29.910 --> 06:31.240
including braised pork,

102
06:31.240 --> 06:32.770
will be good and plentiful.

103
06:32.800 --> 06:33.950
In a word, eat well!

104
06:34.350 --> 06:35.760
Okay, okay, okay!

105
06:37.000 --> 06:38.270
Come, let's eat.

106
06:38.460 --> 06:39.659
Eat more. Have a seat.

107
06:39.960 --> 06:40.840
Eat more.

108
06:43.490 --> 06:44.370
Smells so good.

109
06:56.090 --> 06:56.950
So satisfying.

110
07:03.120 --> 07:04.430
I didn't lie to you, huh?

111
07:04.430 --> 07:05.560
Which one of you has ever had

112
07:05.560 --> 07:08.020
braised pork with white rice in the morning?

113
07:08.160 --> 07:09.550
Yes, exactly.

114
07:10.360 --> 07:12.150
It's just a couple pieces of meat, isn't it?

115
07:12.150 --> 07:12.710
Look.

116
07:12.890 --> 07:14.420
They are so far away from us.

117
07:14.540 --> 07:16.470
Maybe they eat even better than us.

118
07:17.270 --> 07:18.330
I'll go take a look.

119
07:19.600 --> 07:20.560
Give me some.

120
07:34.650 --> 07:35.850
Want to go take a look?

121
07:36.150 --> 07:38.350
Whatever. I'll have another scoop.

122
07:39.050 --> 07:40.010
Come on.

123
07:47.750 --> 07:48.409
Take a look.

124
07:48.430 --> 07:50.750
Fellow villager, is the food okay?

125
07:53.540 --> 07:55.010
It's fine.

126
07:57.990 --> 07:58.920
No rush. Take your time.

127
07:58.920 --> 07:59.510
The porridge will be ready soon.

128
07:59.510 --> 08:00.110
Potatoes.

129
08:00.240 --> 08:01.160
Come on, open it up.

130
08:01.160 --> 08:01.820
Have some more.

131
08:01.820 --> 08:03.070
We've boiled some fresh potatoes for you.

132
08:03.070 --> 08:03.930
Take your time.

133
08:08.520 --> 08:09.280
Have a bowl.

134
08:09.500 --> 08:10.830
Our vegetable porridge

135
08:10.910 --> 08:12.910
isn't as tasty as your braised pork.

136
08:13.940 --> 08:14.910
Here.

137
08:17.120 --> 08:18.180
Fellow villagers,

138
08:18.590 --> 08:20.370
isn't there enough braised pork and white rice?

139
08:20.370 --> 08:21.650
It's enough. More than enough.

140
08:21.650 --> 08:22.380
It's enough.

141
08:22.950 --> 08:23.870
You hired us.

142
08:23.890 --> 08:24.950
You are the bosses.

143
08:24.980 --> 08:26.040
You let us eat solid food,

144
08:26.040 --> 08:27.190
while you eat the watery stuff.

145
08:27.190 --> 08:28.560
We eat cold food on the march.

146
08:28.560 --> 08:30.120
Having a hot meal is already very good.

147
08:30.120 --> 08:31.020
Fellow villagers,

148
08:31.020 --> 08:33.140
we don't have bosses here.

149
08:33.740 --> 08:34.760
You have to row the boats

150
08:34.760 --> 08:37.190
and take our massive army across the river.

151
08:37.330 --> 08:38.590
This is physical work.

152
08:38.650 --> 08:39.659
If you don't eat well,

153
08:39.659 --> 08:40.990
can your bodies hold up?

154
08:41.919 --> 08:43.120
I promise you,

155
08:43.909 --> 08:45.150
three meals during the day,

156
08:45.150 --> 08:46.360
and three meals at night.

157
08:46.360 --> 08:47.490
Meat for every meal!

158
08:47.640 --> 08:50.360
Eat as much white rice and white flour as you want.

159
08:50.360 --> 08:51.310
Great. Sounds good.

160
08:51.310 --> 08:51.910
Also,

161
08:52.190 --> 08:54.320
I brought everyone's wages for today.

162
08:54.580 --> 08:55.910
As we agreed before,

163
08:56.700 --> 08:58.610
five silver dollars per person per day.

164
08:58.610 --> 08:59.540
We settle daily,

165
08:59.750 --> 09:00.700
no delays.

166
09:12.470 --> 09:13.190
No problem.

167
09:13.560 --> 09:15.160
If even one of you doesn't cross the river,

168
09:15.160 --> 09:16.030
hold me responsible.

169
09:16.030 --> 09:16.810
Right! Right!

170
09:16.810 --> 09:18.010
Hold me responsible!

171
09:21.160 --> 09:21.960
Rest assured.

172
09:23.070 --> 09:25.430
Through the fierce waves,

173
09:27.480 --> 09:29.480
treading the dangerous shoals!

174
09:31.150 --> 09:33.360
The boatmen are

175
09:34.960 --> 09:37.200
full of courage!

176
09:40.030 --> 09:42.390
Braving the whirlpools,

177
09:44.050 --> 09:46.080
facing the rapids!

178
09:48.070 --> 09:49.920
Water flies a thousand miles,

179
09:52.010 --> 09:54.010
the boat is like an arrow!

180
09:57.630 --> 10:00.000
Through the fierce waves...

181
10:04.270 --> 10:07.960
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

182
10:08.330 --> 10:12.210
♪ The ever-victorious Red Army comes to cross the river ♪

183
10:12.300 --> 10:15.730
♪ We fear neither the deep water nor the rushing torrent ♪

184
10:16.070 --> 10:19.250
♪ Nor the high mountains and the long road ♪

185
10:19.600 --> 10:22.000
♪ We are truly tenacious ♪

186
10:22.020 --> 10:25.620
♪ We overcome difficulties and all fatigue ♪

187
10:25.650 --> 10:29.170
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

188
10:31.000 --> 10:34.670
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

189
10:35.150 --> 10:39.030
♪ The ever-victorious Red Army comes to cross the river ♪

190
10:39.030 --> 10:42.480
♪ We fear neither the deep water nor the rushing torrent ♪

191
10:42.790 --> 10:45.250
♪ Nor the high mountains and the long road ♪

192
11:30.030 --> 11:31.030
Everyone, keep order.

193
11:31.030 --> 11:33.160
Thirty people for big boats, ten for small boats.

194
11:33.160 --> 11:34.960
Please pay attention to safety!

195
11:44.060 --> 11:44.820
Leaders,

196
11:44.870 --> 11:46.240
you don't need to line up.

197
11:46.240 --> 11:48.080
We'll arrange for you to cross early.

198
11:48.080 --> 11:49.360
Comrade Bocheng is on the other side of the river.

199
11:49.360 --> 11:50.350
He has arranged the campsite

200
11:50.350 --> 11:51.800
and is waiting for you to cross.

201
11:51.800 --> 11:52.800
Comrade Chen Yun.

202
11:53.360 --> 11:55.200
We have all read the Rules of Crossing the River.

203
11:55.200 --> 11:56.550
There are no Military Commission leaders here,

204
11:56.550 --> 11:57.910
only the River Crossing Command.

205
11:57.910 --> 11:59.240
No special privileges.

206
11:59.480 --> 12:00.530
I mainly considered

207
12:00.530 --> 12:02.530
that the leaders still need to work.

208
12:04.930 --> 12:07.530
Report. Urgent telegram from the First Corps.

209
12:07.590 --> 12:09.390
Comrade Chen Yun, did you see that?

210
12:09.390 --> 12:11.010
Work hasn't been delayed at all.

211
12:11.010 --> 12:12.610
Don't worry, go do your work.

212
12:12.640 --> 12:14.030
Okay, I'll get to work then.

213
12:14.030 --> 12:15.790
Enemy planes are bombing continuously.

214
12:15.790 --> 12:16.910
The 1st Corps

215
12:16.930 --> 12:19.330
still hasn't found a way to cross the river.

216
12:20.240 --> 12:22.470
The 3rd Corps only found one small boat.

217
12:23.320 --> 12:24.980
It's been two days and nights,

218
12:25.040 --> 12:27.150
and only the 13th Regiment has crossed the river.

219
12:27.150 --> 12:28.210
If this continues,

220
12:28.410 --> 12:31.340
it will be trouble when the Kuomintang Army attacks.

221
12:36.910 --> 12:38.850
Immediately telegraph the 1st and 3rd Corps.

222
12:38.850 --> 12:41.970
Except for a small part left to confuse the enemy,

223
12:42.480 --> 12:43.280
the main force

224
12:43.720 --> 12:45.830
must all rush to Jiaoping Ferry to cross the river.

225
12:45.830 --> 12:47.030
Is there enough time?

226
12:47.240 --> 12:49.000
The vanguard of Wan Yaohuang's Division

227
12:49.000 --> 12:51.030
and 5th Corps' blocking force

228
12:51.030 --> 12:53.050
have already engaged in the Shibanhe area.

229
12:53.050 --> 12:54.050
The Shibanhe area

230
12:54.350 --> 12:56.550
is very suitable for blocking actions.

231
12:56.840 --> 12:57.440
Besides,

232
12:57.720 --> 13:00.960
judging from this deciphered telegram from the Second Bureau,

233
13:00.960 --> 13:02.360
other Kuomintang troops

234
13:02.440 --> 13:04.150
are still a few days' journey away from us.

235
13:04.150 --> 13:05.350
And that Wan Yaohuang

236
13:05.790 --> 13:06.850
is fighting alone,

237
13:07.080 --> 13:08.670
so his attack is not that resolute.

238
13:08.670 --> 13:09.480
Our 5th Corps

239
13:09.660 --> 13:11.400
can completely buy time for the 1st and 3rd Corps

240
13:11.400 --> 13:12.950
to cross the river

241
13:12.970 --> 13:14.030
at Jiaoping Ferry.

242
13:14.320 --> 13:15.650
There's no time to lose.

243
13:16.240 --> 13:17.320
We must issue orders

244
13:17.320 --> 13:19.120
to all Corps as soon as possible.

245
13:19.210 --> 13:20.320
But if we do this,

246
13:20.630 --> 13:22.320
the commanders and fighters of the 1st and 3rd Corps

247
13:22.320 --> 13:25.320
will have to take a long detour through the mountains.

248
13:25.360 --> 13:26.510
Cross the river first.

249
13:26.510 --> 13:28.640
They will understand sooner or later.

250
13:31.300 --> 13:33.100
Let's go. Cross the river first.

251
15:18.860 --> 15:19.950
Keep up in the back!

252
15:20.270 --> 15:21.580
Walking like this every day,

253
15:21.580 --> 15:22.540
who can stand it?

254
15:23.120 --> 15:23.960
Exactly.

255
15:24.320 --> 15:26.050
Just walking and not fighting,

256
15:26.110 --> 15:27.780
haven't seen a single enemy...

257
15:27.780 --> 15:29.050
-Be careful. -We'll die of exhaustion first.

258
15:29.050 --> 15:29.710
Be careful!

259
15:29.820 --> 15:30.910
Watch out!

260
15:31.330 --> 15:31.990
Be careful!

261
15:35.670 --> 15:37.030
Watch your step!

262
15:40.080 --> 15:41.440
Keep up in the back!

263
15:44.030 --> 15:45.360
Be careful. Be careful.

264
15:46.720 --> 15:47.450
Are you okay?

265
15:48.390 --> 15:49.390
Come on, hurry up.

266
15:49.700 --> 15:51.230
Come on, keep up in the back!

267
15:52.360 --> 15:54.480
The Military Commission surely doesn't know

268
15:54.480 --> 15:55.790
how hard this road is to walk.

269
15:55.790 --> 15:56.470
Come on.

270
15:56.750 --> 15:57.550
Give me a hand.

271
15:57.630 --> 15:58.440
Next one, come on.

272
15:58.440 --> 16:00.120
One, two, three, go!

273
16:00.240 --> 16:00.840
Go!

274
16:00.890 --> 16:02.020
Come up, be careful!

275
16:02.260 --> 16:03.340
Be careful.

276
16:13.140 --> 16:14.060
Recently,

277
16:14.510 --> 16:16.770
the road has indeed been a bit difficult.

278
16:16.790 --> 16:17.750
But the order says

279
16:17.140 --> 16:19.740
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps] [Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

280
16:18.270 --> 16:19.810
we can cross the river at Jiaoping Ferry.

281
16:19.810 --> 16:22.010
We should just resolutely carry it out.

282
16:22.360 --> 16:23.240
For the past

283
16:23.590 --> 16:24.640
two months or so,

284
16:25.390 --> 16:26.510
instead of taking the straight path,

285
16:26.510 --> 16:27.750
we've been taking the long way around.

286
16:27.750 --> 16:29.870
This completely ignores the difficulties of the grassroots.

287
16:29.870 --> 16:30.930
If this continues,

288
16:31.440 --> 16:33.240
the troops will be dragged down.

289
16:34.100 --> 16:35.200
Watch your step, wounded.

290
16:35.200 --> 16:36.050
Be careful.

291
16:36.170 --> 16:37.230
Careful, careful.

292
16:37.480 --> 16:37.940
Come on.

293
16:38.440 --> 16:39.500
Keep up in the back.

294
16:40.510 --> 16:41.170
Be careful.

295
16:41.360 --> 16:41.870
Come on.

296
16:42.480 --> 16:43.410
Come on, come on.

297
16:43.550 --> 16:44.360
Slow down, you wounded.

298
16:44.360 --> 16:44.840
Slow down.

299
16:44.840 --> 16:46.770
Can his way of commanding work?

300
16:47.530 --> 16:48.530
Comrade Lin Biao,

301
16:48.770 --> 16:50.370
I don't agree with your view!

302
16:51.020 --> 16:52.920
We are currently in the enemy's pocket.

303
16:52.920 --> 16:54.440
If we don't use diversionary tactics and stay highly mobile,

304
16:54.440 --> 16:55.440
how can we get out?

305
16:55.680 --> 16:57.320
This is a critical moment for the revolution.

306
16:57.320 --> 16:58.670
If you don't want Chairman Mao's leadership,

307
16:58.670 --> 17:00.200
then who do you want to lead?

308
17:03.290 --> 17:04.329
Watch your step!

309
17:05.550 --> 17:06.280
Are you okay?

310
17:06.290 --> 17:06.920
Watch your step.

311
17:06.920 --> 17:08.200
Get up. Let's go.

312
17:09.829 --> 17:11.480
I'm going to write to the Central Committee.

313
17:11.480 --> 17:12.230
You...

314
17:23.940 --> 17:29.760
[Kunming, Yunnan]

315
17:39.770 --> 17:40.380
Cousin,

316
17:40.890 --> 17:42.530
here is the air force reconnaissance report.

317
17:42.530 --> 17:45.170
[Lu Han, Yunnan Provincial Superintendent of Militia Affairs of Kuomintang]

318
17:42.590 --> 17:43.750
They found a large number of Communist Army troops

319
17:43.750 --> 17:45.320
active around Jiaoping Ferry.

320
17:45.320 --> 17:47.210
[Long Yun, Commander-in-Chief of the Kuomintang's 2nd Route Pursuit Army and Chairman of Yunnan Provincial Government]

321
17:45.590 --> 17:47.650
Liu Yuantang on the opposite bank also sent an urgent telegram,

322
17:47.650 --> 17:48.650
saying the Communist Army launched a surprise attack,

323
17:48.650 --> 17:50.070
occupied Tong'an Prefecture (present-day Huili, Sichuan),

324
17:50.070 --> 17:51.920
and their main force is crossing the river at Jiaoping Ferry,

325
17:51.920 --> 17:55.520
requesting us to dispatch troops immediately to suppress them.

326
18:00.370 --> 18:01.440
Let me think.

327
18:06.590 --> 18:07.680
So that means

328
18:09.200 --> 18:12.680
the Communist Army's presence around Longjie Ferry in Yuanmou

329
18:12.680 --> 18:14.030
was indeed a feint.

330
18:14.230 --> 18:16.430
We probably fell for their trick again.

331
18:17.000 --> 18:18.000
That's not right.

332
18:18.310 --> 18:20.920
The 13th Division of the Central Army under Wan Yaohuang

333
18:20.920 --> 18:22.160
is not far from Jiaoping Ferry.

334
18:22.160 --> 18:23.240
For several days in a row,

335
18:23.240 --> 18:26.700
he has said there is no sign of the Communist Army's movements.

336
18:27.270 --> 18:30.400
If the reports from the air force and Liu Yuantang are correct,

337
18:30.400 --> 18:31.400
it only means that

338
18:31.720 --> 18:33.030
Wan Yaohuang is lying.

339
18:33.350 --> 18:34.650
He is deliberately turning a blind eye

340
18:34.650 --> 18:36.000
to protect himself.

341
18:38.800 --> 18:41.530
The Central Army also has its own hidden agendas.

342
18:43.360 --> 18:45.360
How should we respond next?

343
18:46.550 --> 18:49.640
Report the situation truthfully to Generalissimo Chiang.

344
18:49.640 --> 18:51.350
If the Communist Army enters Sichuan,

345
18:51.350 --> 18:55.110
who do you think Generalissimo Chiang will scold?

346
18:59.670 --> 19:03.680
[Guiyang, Guizhou]

347
19:00.010 --> 19:01.080
This Wan Yaohuang

348
19:01.110 --> 19:03.880
is extremely bold and foolish!

349
19:04.960 --> 19:05.880
Generalissimo.

350
19:05.880 --> 19:07.960
The Zhu-Mao Communist Army has always been cunning.

351
19:07.960 --> 19:10.150
Wan Yaohuang's lone army advanced too far.

352
19:10.150 --> 19:11.030
Being a bit cautious

353
19:11.030 --> 19:12.270
is understandable.

354
19:13.550 --> 19:15.960
Cixiu (Chen Cheng), you are foolish.

355
19:16.480 --> 19:19.030
They wish they could fly north

356
19:19.270 --> 19:21.730
and join forces with Xu Xiangqian's troops.

357
19:21.830 --> 19:23.070
At this time,

358
19:23.550 --> 19:25.920
how could he linger north of the river?

359
19:26.960 --> 19:29.790
Wan Yaohuang's approach is not about self-preservation,

360
19:29.790 --> 19:31.450
but concealing information,

361
19:32.030 --> 19:34.000
causing the Party to miss the opportunity

362
19:34.000 --> 19:36.680
and letting Long Yun take advantage.

363
19:41.240 --> 19:43.100
I didn't consider it thoroughly.

364
19:43.110 --> 19:45.030
Send a telegram to Long Yun and Xue Yue,

365
19:45.030 --> 19:46.690
telling them to urge all units

366
19:46.800 --> 19:48.840
to advance towards Jiaoping Ferry,

367
19:49.000 --> 19:51.380
striving to strike the enemy mid-crossing.

368
19:51.380 --> 19:53.480
Those who disobey will be court-martialed.

369
19:53.480 --> 19:54.200
-Yes. -Yes.

370
19:54.370 --> 19:55.130
Oh right.

371
19:55.480 --> 19:56.350
Order the air force

372
19:56.350 --> 19:57.830
to prepare a special plane.

373
19:57.830 --> 20:00.200
I'm going to Yunnan to supervise the battle.

374
20:00.200 --> 20:02.600
I'll start right over Wan Yaohuang's head!

375
20:02.620 --> 20:03.340
-Yes! -Yes!

376
20:03.920 --> 20:08.670
[Tuanjie, Luquan County, Yunnan Province]

377
20:26.180 --> 20:27.310
Attention!

378
20:28.280 --> 20:29.290
Salute!

379
20:31.670 --> 20:34.010
[Wan Yaohuang, Commander of the 13th Division of the 2nd Column of the Kuomintang's 2nd Route Pursuit Army]

380
20:41.270 --> 20:42.050
At ease!

381
20:44.110 --> 20:45.320
They're leaving just like that?

382
20:45.320 --> 20:47.380
I thought they were airdropping ham.

383
20:47.400 --> 20:48.270
In your dreams.

384
20:48.300 --> 20:50.130
How about airdropping you a wife?

385
20:50.130 --> 20:53.060
Report! Generalissimo Chiang's airdropped order.

386
20:56.370 --> 20:58.000
Commander, what does it say?

387
20:59.030 --> 21:01.630
It orders us to attack towards Jiaoping Ferry.

388
21:02.480 --> 21:03.400
We must arrive immediately.

389
21:03.400 --> 21:05.860
Those who disobey will be court-martialed.

390
21:06.310 --> 21:07.970
But we only have one Division.

391
21:08.510 --> 21:09.640
Let's fight and see.

392
21:09.720 --> 21:11.720
Order all Regiments to turn around immediately

393
21:11.720 --> 21:14.030
and advance towards Jiaoping Ferry.

394
21:14.200 --> 21:15.950
Maintain a proper distance between Regiments.

395
21:15.950 --> 21:16.930
Do not advance rashly.

396
21:16.930 --> 21:17.530
Yes!

397
21:19.590 --> 21:20.310
Attention!

398
21:20.400 --> 21:21.810
Right face!

399
21:23.030 --> 21:24.030
Shoulder arms!

400
21:24.830 --> 21:25.790
Two columns to the left!

401
21:25.790 --> 21:27.340
Double time, march!

402
21:34.310 --> 21:34.990
Guo.

403
21:35.200 --> 21:36.790
When can we change our diet?

404
21:37.400 --> 21:38.640
Eating this every day,

405
21:38.640 --> 21:40.040
I don't even dare to walk,

406
21:40.590 --> 21:42.880
afraid a fart will blow me three feet away.

407
21:42.880 --> 21:43.880
That's great.

408
21:43.980 --> 21:45.840
It saves you effort going uphill.

409
21:46.270 --> 21:46.930
Look at him.

410
21:47.110 --> 21:47.640
Yeah.

411
21:53.990 --> 21:54.800
Take a break.

412
21:57.090 --> 21:58.020
Just put it here.

413
22:01.310 --> 22:02.310
Drink some water.

414
22:08.860 --> 22:09.780
Gou Yazi.

415
22:10.750 --> 22:11.880
Where are you going?

416
22:12.160 --> 22:13.350
I'm going to take a shit.

417
22:13.350 --> 22:14.680
Take the shovel!

418
22:16.070 --> 22:17.390
Is your foot okay?

419
22:19.880 --> 22:20.840
Guo.

420
22:22.280 --> 22:23.650
Don't forget to shake the tree!

421
22:23.650 --> 22:24.390
Got it.

422
22:27.360 --> 22:27.880
Come.

423
22:27.900 --> 22:29.100
Come on, give me some.

424
22:29.470 --> 22:30.310
It hurts.

425
22:30.800 --> 22:32.000
Come on, bear with it.

426
22:35.430 --> 22:36.250
Okay.

427
22:49.620 --> 22:50.380
Eat some.

428
22:50.810 --> 22:51.920
I can't eat.

429
23:00.880 --> 23:01.920
Give me a drink.

430
23:03.030 --> 23:03.880
Gou Yazi!

431
23:04.000 --> 23:04.630
What?

432
23:04.930 --> 23:06.930
You even care when I'm taking a shit?

433
23:07.010 --> 23:08.330
Shake the tree!

434
23:08.350 --> 23:09.480
I have no strength left.

435
23:09.480 --> 23:11.000
You still have to shake it!

436
23:11.790 --> 23:12.640
Okay.

437
23:14.640 --> 23:15.550
This kid.

438
23:22.590 --> 23:23.590
Hurry up!

439
23:24.310 --> 23:25.310
Okay.

440
23:47.430 --> 23:48.430
Done.

441
23:49.270 --> 23:50.130
Did you bury it?

442
23:50.330 --> 23:51.170
Yes.

443
23:55.210 --> 23:56.010
Guo.

444
23:56.270 --> 23:57.970
When will you cook us a pot

445
23:58.110 --> 23:59.180
of vegetable paste?

446
23:59.180 --> 24:00.110
Yeah, yeah.

447
24:00.110 --> 24:02.500
Eating these bitter buckwheat lumps every day,

448
24:02.500 --> 24:03.640
we can't swallow them,

449
24:03.640 --> 24:05.100
and we can't poop them out.

450
24:05.490 --> 24:07.630
What dish are you going to cook for us today?

451
24:07.630 --> 24:09.350
Yeah, yeah.

452
24:09.810 --> 24:10.410
What dish?

453
24:10.440 --> 24:11.230
Yeah.

454
24:11.480 --> 24:11.940
Then...

455
24:12.030 --> 24:12.480
Right.

456
24:12.550 --> 24:13.910
Yunnan Steam Pot Chicken?

457
24:13.910 --> 24:14.790
We've had that.

458
24:15.200 --> 24:16.110
We just had it the day before yesterday.

459
24:16.110 --> 24:17.970
How about Guizhou Sour Soup Fish?

460
24:18.270 --> 24:19.030
Pick another one.

461
24:19.030 --> 24:19.590
We've had it three times.

462
24:19.590 --> 24:20.510
Pick another one.

463
24:20.510 --> 24:21.840
Then what should I cook?

464
24:22.560 --> 24:24.270
How about Lianhua Blood Duck?

465
24:24.680 --> 24:25.480
Sure.

466
24:25.480 --> 24:26.790
This works.

467
24:27.440 --> 24:28.770
This Lianhua Blood Duck

468
24:28.920 --> 24:30.400
is a famous dish from our Jiangxi's

469
24:30.400 --> 24:32.230
Lianhua County.

470
24:32.510 --> 24:34.110
First, let's talk about the duck.

471
24:34.110 --> 24:35.160
The duck

472
24:35.350 --> 24:38.280
must be a young duck weighing about a pound and a half.

473
24:38.920 --> 24:39.440
A young duck...

474
24:39.440 --> 24:40.240
Not an old one.

475
24:40.250 --> 24:43.060
If it's old, the meat will be tough and not tender.

476
24:43.360 --> 24:44.860
After catching the duck,

477
24:44.880 --> 24:46.050
you first have to kill it

478
24:46.050 --> 24:48.530
and get a bowl of fresh duck blood.

479
24:48.560 --> 24:50.160
Then heat the oil in the wok.

480
24:50.750 --> 24:52.790
You must be particular about the oil.

481
24:52.790 --> 24:54.700
It must be premium tea oil.

482
24:55.590 --> 24:56.840
Other oils won't work.

483
24:56.840 --> 24:58.400
They can't bring out the flavor.

484
24:58.400 --> 25:00.920
Then, stir-fry the small red peppers,

485
25:01.350 --> 25:03.440
ginger slices, and garlic

486
25:03.610 --> 25:05.310
until fragrant.

487
25:05.720 --> 25:07.120
Along the edge of the wok,

488
25:07.150 --> 25:08.880
slide the tender young duck in.

489
25:09.400 --> 25:10.550
Sizzle —

490
25:11.700 --> 25:12.980
just like that.

491
25:14.000 --> 25:14.640
Oh right.

492
25:14.790 --> 25:16.590
Before putting the duck meat in the wok,

493
25:16.590 --> 25:18.110
you have to use the back of the knife

494
25:18.110 --> 25:19.480
to beat it a bit.

495
25:21.030 --> 25:22.100
Why? Why?

496
25:22.230 --> 25:23.820
Ducks are like people.

497
25:23.890 --> 25:26.000
Before going into the wok, you have to massage it

498
25:26.000 --> 25:28.200
and loosen its bones!

499
25:28.520 --> 25:31.480
Otherwise, the flavor won't get in.

500
25:31.890 --> 25:34.200
After stir-frying for the time it takes to smoke half a pipe,

501
25:34.200 --> 25:35.680
you should turn down the heat.

502
25:35.680 --> 25:37.480
Let it simmer on low heat,

503
25:37.830 --> 25:39.000
bubbling away.

504
25:39.440 --> 25:42.680
You'll see the duck fat coating the small red peppers,

505
25:43.030 --> 25:45.090
bubbling away.

506
25:45.310 --> 25:47.350
It smells so good.

507
25:47.840 --> 25:48.570
At this time,

508
25:48.800 --> 25:50.550
we should put the duck blood in,

509
25:50.570 --> 25:51.640
and stir-fry it

510
25:51.830 --> 25:53.700
over high heat to bring out the flavor.

511
25:53.700 --> 25:55.300
Mix it with two bowls of rice.

512
25:55.560 --> 25:56.800
Once you eat it,

513
25:56.990 --> 25:58.650
you won't even miss your wife!

514
26:00.090 --> 26:01.480
Wait.

515
26:02.200 --> 26:03.350
I forgot to add two spoons

516
26:03.350 --> 26:05.550
of our Jiangxi rice wine!

517
26:06.400 --> 26:08.130
You're still talking about it!

518
26:10.310 --> 26:11.480
Let's go!

519
26:11.500 --> 26:12.780
Let's go.

520
26:15.050 --> 26:15.570
Come on.

521
26:15.730 --> 26:16.790
We're moving out!

522
26:33.460 --> 26:34.460
Corps Commander.

523
26:34.750 --> 26:36.400
You've been carrying it for a long time.

524
26:36.400 --> 26:36.970
Let me do it.

525
26:36.970 --> 26:37.690
Stop nagging!

526
26:37.690 --> 26:38.610
Let me do it.

527
26:39.680 --> 26:41.640
Comrades, hold on!

528
26:41.830 --> 26:42.980
Hold on!

529
26:49.120 --> 26:52.250
Report! Urgent telegram from the Military Commission.

530
26:53.160 --> 26:54.200
Let me do it.

531
26:58.550 --> 26:59.440
Shangkun,

532
26:59.880 --> 27:00.840
do you want some water?

533
27:00.840 --> 27:02.840
Comrade Shaoqi, please put me down.

534
27:02.870 --> 27:03.640
Take a rest.

535
27:03.900 --> 27:05.820
I'm fine. I can hold on!

536
27:07.920 --> 27:08.920
Peng.

537
27:10.310 --> 27:11.720
The Military Commission orders our Corps,

538
27:11.720 --> 27:12.590
after crossing the river,

539
27:12.590 --> 27:14.730
[Peng Dehuai, Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

540
27:12.680 --> 27:14.920
to attack Huili County immediately.

541
27:15.510 --> 27:17.510
No rest after crossing the river?

542
27:18.110 --> 27:19.910
I didn't see the word "rest."

543
27:20.880 --> 27:21.920
Our 3rd Corps,

544
27:22.270 --> 27:23.870
since the Battle of Tucheng,

545
27:24.430 --> 27:26.560
hasn't stopped for over three months.

546
27:27.240 --> 27:28.270
A few days ago,

547
27:28.640 --> 27:31.330
Huang Kecheng came specifically to report the situation,

548
27:31.330 --> 27:34.440
saying that the troops are very emotional now.

549
27:35.150 --> 27:37.220
After continuous long-distance marches,

550
27:37.220 --> 27:39.400
the troops are exhausted to the extreme.

551
27:39.400 --> 27:41.260
It's understandable that the soldiers are emotional.

552
27:41.260 --> 27:45.580
[Liu Shaoqi, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee and Director of the Political Department of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

553
27:41.640 --> 27:43.970
But at this moment, we haven't completely

554
27:44.270 --> 27:46.480
broken through the enemy's encirclement.

555
27:46.480 --> 27:48.180
For the Central Committee to issue such an order now,

556
27:48.180 --> 27:50.700
they must have thought it through carefully.

557
27:50.700 --> 27:53.470
[Yang Shangkun, Political Commissar of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

558
27:51.000 --> 27:53.600
So we should still trust the Central Committee

559
27:53.960 --> 27:55.110
and Chairman Mao.

560
27:55.640 --> 27:56.700
Orders are orders.

561
27:57.110 --> 27:58.790
They must be executed without compromise.

562
27:58.790 --> 28:00.640
The soldiers being emotional

563
28:01.160 --> 28:03.620
shows they don't understand the superiors'

564
28:04.000 --> 28:05.090
strategic intentions yet.

565
28:05.090 --> 28:06.400
We just need to strengthen education.

566
28:06.400 --> 28:07.460
Comrade Jianying,

567
28:08.240 --> 28:09.160
pass this on.

568
28:09.550 --> 28:10.110
Also,

569
28:10.190 --> 28:11.790
order the troops to speed up.

570
28:12.550 --> 28:13.550
-Okay. -Let's go!

571
28:13.570 --> 28:15.570
Comrades, keep up!

572
28:15.980 --> 28:20.460
[The blocking position of the 5th Red Army Corps, Shibanhe, South bank of the Jinsha River, Yunnan]

573
29:00.370 --> 29:01.880
Tell the commanders and fighters at all levels

574
29:01.880 --> 29:03.440
that the Kuomintang army opposite us

575
29:03.440 --> 29:05.290
is Wan Yaohuang's 13th Division,

576
29:05.290 --> 29:07.620
our old rival from the Xiang River Battle!

577
29:07.650 --> 29:08.410
Comrades,

578
29:08.860 --> 29:10.100
we must be brave in battle,

579
29:09.900 --> 29:13.710
[Dong Zhentang, Commander of the 5th Red Army Corps]

580
29:10.450 --> 29:11.510
wipe out the enemy,

581
29:11.920 --> 29:14.270
and avenge our fallen comrades

582
29:14.680 --> 29:15.960
of the 34th Division!

583
29:21.110 --> 29:23.070
Comrades, watch your step!

584
29:23.830 --> 29:24.480
Keep up!

585
29:24.480 --> 29:25.590
Watch your step!

586
29:25.750 --> 29:26.440
Comrades!

587
29:26.440 --> 29:27.270
Hold on tight!

588
29:28.070 --> 29:28.880
Three in a row!

589
29:28.880 --> 29:30.000
Hold on to each other!

590
29:30.000 --> 29:30.790
Watch your step!

591
29:30.790 --> 29:31.450
Hold tight!

592
29:32.960 --> 29:34.550
Three in a row, hold tight!

593
29:37.200 --> 29:38.330
Keep up, those behind!

594
29:38.330 --> 29:39.170
Three in a row!

595
29:39.200 --> 29:40.470
Hold on to each other!

596
29:42.860 --> 29:43.900
Keep up!

597
29:47.150 --> 29:48.560
Keep up!

598
29:49.750 --> 29:50.790
Hold tight!

599
29:54.010 --> 29:55.250
Keep up, keep up!

600
29:56.510 --> 29:58.270
Watch your step, comrades!

601
30:00.120 --> 30:01.880
Watch your step!

602
30:02.080 --> 30:03.840
Hold steady.

603
30:05.790 --> 30:07.310
Watch your step!

604
30:08.290 --> 30:09.530
Comrades!

605
30:09.880 --> 30:12.510
Let's walk arm in arm!

606
30:12.880 --> 30:14.080
Don't fall behind!

607
30:14.590 --> 30:16.400
Perseverance means victory!

608
30:16.400 --> 30:17.510
Chairman Mao,

609
30:17.510 --> 30:18.640
Commander-in-Chief Zhu,

610
30:18.640 --> 30:20.850
and the leaders of the CPC Central Committee and the Military Commission

611
30:20.850 --> 30:23.860
are all waiting for us on the north bank of the Jinsha River!

612
30:23.860 --> 30:26.410
Victory belongs to us!

613
30:26.440 --> 30:32.920
Victory! Victory! Victory!

614
30:33.960 --> 30:34.680
Luo Dahua!

615
30:34.700 --> 30:35.150
Here!

616
30:35.360 --> 30:36.560
Your propaganda troupe,

617
30:36.560 --> 30:38.060
sing the song

618
30:36.840 --> 30:38.960
[Zhu Rui, Director of the Political Department of the 1st Red Army Corps]

619
30:38.320 --> 30:39.480
written by Peng Jialun!

620
30:39.480 --> 30:40.160
Yes!

621
30:40.270 --> 30:41.400
Xie, start us off!

622
30:41.720 --> 30:42.400
Yes!

623
30:42.920 --> 30:46.440
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

624
30:46.550 --> 30:48.200
-Ready, sing! -Ready, sing!

625
30:48.350 --> 30:52.030
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

626
30:52.510 --> 30:56.400
♪ The ever-victorious Red Army comes to cross the river ♪

627
30:56.400 --> 30:59.830
♪ We fear neither the deep water nor the rushing torrent ♪

628
31:00.160 --> 31:03.880
♪ Nor the high mountains and the long road ♪

629
31:03.880 --> 31:06.200
♪ We are truly tenacious ♪

630
31:06.200 --> 31:09.790
♪ We overcome difficulties and all fatigue ♪

631
31:09.830 --> 31:13.350
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

632
31:13.750 --> 31:17.270
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

633
31:17.880 --> 31:21.550
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

634
31:22.350 --> 31:26.400
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

635
31:26.400 --> 31:30.440
♪ The ever-victorious Red Army comes to cross the river ♪

636
31:48.920 --> 31:55.550
[North bank of the Jinsha River, Yunnan]

637
32:29.910 --> 32:31.440
Chairman, it's time to eat.

638
32:34.510 --> 32:36.440
Who told you to touch my work stuff?

639
32:36.510 --> 32:38.310
I haven't finished working yet.

640
32:38.400 --> 32:39.720
It's time. You should eat.

641
32:39.720 --> 32:40.750
Forget about eating!

642
32:40.510 --> 32:41.690
[Chen Changfeng, Mao Zedong's Guard]

643
32:41.550 --> 32:43.440
Haven't you also not eaten all day?

644
32:43.440 --> 32:44.880
Then why should I eat?

645
32:45.350 --> 32:46.610
My writing materials,

646
32:46.720 --> 32:48.750
don't touch them unless I tell you to!

647
32:48.750 --> 32:50.440
Eating on time is a rule!

648
32:51.720 --> 32:53.580
Are you in charge of my eating now?

649
32:53.590 --> 32:55.480
Is this the time to eat and sleep?

650
32:55.920 --> 32:57.160
There are still twenty or thirty thousand comrades on the other side

651
32:57.160 --> 32:58.690
waiting to cross the river!

652
33:03.710 --> 33:04.710
Put it back for me.

653
33:27.620 --> 33:29.510
This thing was originally placed here.

654
33:29.510 --> 33:30.580
You should...

655
33:44.100 --> 33:44.690
Go eat.

656
33:45.030 --> 33:45.720
I won't eat!

657
33:49.270 --> 33:50.200
Comrade Zedong.

658
33:51.790 --> 33:53.790
The 9th Corps has already

659
33:53.820 --> 33:55.750
successfully crossed the Jinsha River from Dongchuan.

660
33:55.750 --> 33:57.640
Also, the vanguard of the 3rd Corps

661
33:57.640 --> 33:58.560
and the Red 11th Regiment

662
33:58.560 --> 33:59.630
have reached the ferry crossing.

663
33:59.630 --> 34:00.680
The rest of the Regiments

664
34:00.680 --> 34:01.900
are following closely behind.

665
34:01.900 --> 34:03.440
It is expected that by tomorrow morning,

666
34:03.440 --> 34:05.500
they will all have crossed the river.

667
34:06.470 --> 34:07.200
Good.

668
34:07.880 --> 34:10.210
Are you still worried about the 1st Corps?

669
34:10.440 --> 34:11.120
Yes.

670
34:11.650 --> 34:14.110
I won't be at ease until they cross the river.

671
34:15.739 --> 34:18.540
They walked 240 li of mountain roads in three days.

672
34:19.170 --> 34:20.429
It's been hard on them.

673
34:21.880 --> 34:23.219
But if they can't make it,

674
34:23.219 --> 34:25.020
they will be cut off by the enemy.

675
34:25.510 --> 34:26.320
Rest assured.

676
34:26.580 --> 34:27.560
The previous deployment

677
34:27.560 --> 34:28.530
has already won us

678
34:28.530 --> 34:29.940
enough strategic space.

679
34:30.360 --> 34:32.960
The Xiang River tragedy will not happen again.

680
34:34.030 --> 34:36.280
Comrade Zedong, let's eat first.

681
34:39.210 --> 34:39.870
Okay.

682
34:41.260 --> 34:42.389
Let's eat together.

683
34:43.820 --> 34:44.570
Time to eat.

684
34:49.139 --> 34:50.070
Little Sparrow.

685
34:50.150 --> 34:51.510
You have two choices now.

686
34:51.510 --> 34:52.239
One is to eat.

687
34:52.510 --> 34:53.070
The other is

688
34:53.070 --> 34:54.320
to copy the text I gave you yesterday

689
34:54.320 --> 34:55.320
ten times!

690
35:07.830 --> 35:08.520
Thank you.

691
35:22.770 --> 35:24.300
I'll trade you this big one.

692
35:26.270 --> 35:28.130
Otherwise, copy it twenty times.

693
35:41.850 --> 35:43.700
You can eat one chili pepper.

694
35:46.210 --> 35:47.230
Only one.

695
35:48.220 --> 35:49.420
Thank you, Chairman.

696
36:04.270 --> 36:09.220
[The blocking position of the 5th Red Army Corps, Shibanhe, South bank of the Jinsha River, Yunnan]

697
36:25.880 --> 36:27.070
Charge!

698
36:39.850 --> 36:40.400
Commander.

699
36:40.400 --> 36:41.990
The Communist Army is fighting like they don't care about their lives.

700
36:41.990 --> 36:42.860
Within half an hour,

701
36:42.860 --> 36:43.760
they have already launched

702
36:43.760 --> 36:45.520
three counter-charges against us.

703
36:45.520 --> 36:47.050
Look at those broadswords.

704
36:47.150 --> 36:48.280
They look familiar.

705
36:48.440 --> 36:50.000
Order all Regiments to retreat.

706
36:50.000 --> 36:51.260
How do we explain this to the higher-ups?

707
36:51.260 --> 36:52.320
We can't beat them.

708
36:52.420 --> 36:53.230
Just say that?

709
36:53.740 --> 36:55.200
Can't you be more tactful?

710
36:55.420 --> 36:56.110
Understood.

711
36:56.110 --> 36:56.800
I'll just say,

712
36:56.800 --> 36:58.480
our army fought fiercely with the enemy until late at night,

713
36:58.480 --> 36:59.590
and the enemy held their ground.

714
36:59.590 --> 37:00.150
After reconnaissance,

715
37:00.150 --> 37:01.650
it seems a large number of reinforcements have arrived.

716
37:01.650 --> 37:02.420
To prevent any accidents,

717
37:02.420 --> 37:04.390
our Division has decided to hold the defense line

718
37:04.390 --> 37:06.050
and wait for reinforcements.

719
37:07.880 --> 37:09.140
Add one more sentence.

720
37:09.180 --> 37:10.560
We earnestly request reinforcements to arrive quickly,

721
37:10.560 --> 37:11.760
so as not to miss the opportunity for battle.

722
37:11.760 --> 37:12.270
Yes.

723
37:15.250 --> 37:18.770
♪ The Jinsha River waters roar and splash ♪

724
37:19.030 --> 37:22.590
♪ The ever-victorious Red Army comes to cross the river ♪

725
37:22.960 --> 37:26.590
♪ We fear neither the deep water nor the rushing torrent ♪

726
37:26.840 --> 37:30.230
♪ Nor the high mountains and the long road ♪

727
37:30.230 --> 37:32.230
♪ We are truly tenacious ♪

728
37:32.320 --> 37:34.590
♪ We overcome difficulties ♪

729
37:34.590 --> 37:36.360
♪ And overcome all the fatigue ♪

730
37:36.360 --> 37:39.880
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

731
37:40.360 --> 37:43.590
♪ We are determined to cross the river ♪

732
37:57.130 --> 37:59.360
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Commissioner of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

733
38:05.340 --> 38:07.880
[Kai Feng (He Kequan), Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

734
38:07.620 --> 38:08.950
Comrade Bo Gu.

735
38:09.360 --> 38:11.110
What are you thinking about?

736
38:11.960 --> 38:13.400
I was thinking,

737
38:13.580 --> 38:18.700
if Comrade Li De and I were still commanding the Red Army,

738
38:19.280 --> 38:21.570
would we be crossing the Jinsha River

739
38:21.910 --> 38:24.390
like we are today?

740
38:24.720 --> 38:26.320
I've been reflecting lately

741
38:26.530 --> 38:28.930
on my previous views of Comrade Mao Zedong.

742
38:29.200 --> 38:30.930
Have you reached a conclusion?

743
38:31.130 --> 38:33.390
A few months ago at the Zunyi Conference,

744
38:33.700 --> 38:34.730
I said he fought

745
38:34.760 --> 38:36.400
relying on Sun Tzu's The Art of War,

746
38:36.400 --> 38:37.680
not Marxism.

747
38:38.320 --> 38:39.630
But now I think

748
38:40.150 --> 38:41.670
his command is correct.

749
38:42.370 --> 38:43.400
Comrade Kai Feng.

750
38:43.910 --> 38:45.280
You've changed a lot.

751
38:49.970 --> 38:51.370
But as far as I know,

752
38:52.180 --> 38:54.470
some people have voiced different opinions

753
38:54.470 --> 38:56.870
about Comrade Mao Zedong's command again.

754
39:26.050 --> 39:27.450
The 1st Corps has come up.

755
39:28.320 --> 39:29.800
They are coming over.

756
39:31.240 --> 39:33.040
Troops breaking through a siege

757
39:33.290 --> 39:35.290
can still be so orderly.

758
39:36.420 --> 39:38.460
Only our Red Army can do it.

759
39:40.050 --> 39:42.450
This is the key to our invincibility.

760
39:42.930 --> 39:44.530
After wandering for months,

761
39:45.090 --> 39:46.260
we made it over.

762
39:48.410 --> 39:50.010
After wandering for months,

763
39:50.260 --> 39:51.760
crossing the Jinsha River,

764
39:51.760 --> 39:54.720
we have truly shaken off

765
39:54.790 --> 39:56.720
Chiang Kai-shek's army that has been tailing us

766
39:56.720 --> 39:58.250
since the strategic shift.

767
39:58.720 --> 40:00.280
This is a huge victory.

768
40:01.110 --> 40:02.710
After wandering for months,

769
40:03.070 --> 40:04.110
our victory

770
40:04.130 --> 40:05.780
is just like when Zhuge Liang

771
40:05.830 --> 40:08.190
crossed the Lu River in May, went deep into the barren lands,

772
40:08.190 --> 40:09.520
and pacified Nanzhong.

773
40:09.630 --> 40:10.920
It is also May now.

774
40:11.480 --> 40:12.550
We cross the river from here,

775
40:12.550 --> 40:13.950
head north into Sichuan,

776
40:14.180 --> 40:16.620
hoping to open up a new world.

777
40:21.070 --> 40:21.840
Mao.

778
40:22.150 --> 40:23.610
You can write a poem again.

779
40:40.100 --> 40:41.930
Waves of the Jinsha beat warmly

780
40:43.780 --> 40:45.240
on the cloud-girt cliffs.

781
40:56.370 --> 40:58.100
Waves of the Jinsha beat warmly

782
41:00.130 --> 41:01.590
on the cloud-girt cliffs.

783
41:06.480 --> 41:08.960
On May 9, 1935,

784
41:09.290 --> 41:11.320
as the 5th Red Army Corps, which served as the rear guard for the whole army,

785
41:11.320 --> 41:14.070
finally crossed the Jinsha River,

786
41:14.430 --> 41:16.510
the Central Red Army left Yunnan

787
41:16.530 --> 41:18.410
and entered Sichuan Province.

788
41:18.870 --> 41:19.790
At this point,

789
41:19.910 --> 41:21.480
the Central Red Army realized

790
41:21.480 --> 41:23.970
the strategic policy of crossing the river and heading north,

791
41:23.970 --> 41:26.700
basically getting rid of the critical and passive situation

792
41:26.700 --> 41:28.750
of being surrounded, pursued, and intercepted

793
41:28.750 --> 41:32.550
by hundreds of thousands of enemy troops since the strategic shift.

794
41:32.590 --> 41:35.070
From January 29, 1935,

795
41:35.110 --> 41:36.430
when they first crossed the Chishui River,

796
41:36.430 --> 41:39.110
to May 9, when they cleverly crossed the Jinsha River,

797
41:39.110 --> 41:41.640
Mao Zedong and others led the Central Red Army

798
41:41.680 --> 41:44.470
to create a 100-day war legend.

799
41:45.150 --> 41:47.290
Battlefield opponent Chiang Kai-shek

800
41:47.290 --> 41:49.640
said in his diary on May 10,

801
41:50.240 --> 41:52.900
"The bandits have all crossed the Jinsha River.

802
41:53.500 --> 41:54.960
The speed of their fleeing

803
41:55.230 --> 41:57.890
adds to our psychological distress."

804
41:58.960 --> 42:00.170
On May 11,

805
42:00.540 --> 42:01.980
he added,

806
42:03.030 --> 42:06.190
"Zhu and Mao's bandits have all crossed the Jinsha River,

807
42:06.190 --> 42:08.920
while our troops are sluggish and clumsy,

808
42:09.100 --> 42:11.030
being played and deceived by them.

809
42:11.400 --> 42:14.550
This is the greatest shame of my military life."

810
42:18.290 --> 42:22.200
[North bank of the Jinsha River, Yunnan]

811
42:29.470 --> 42:30.510
Fellow villager.

812
42:31.090 --> 42:34.260
This is the money for the last day of crossing the river,

813
42:34.760 --> 42:36.640
and the money to compensate you for the boats.

814
42:36.640 --> 42:38.070
It's too much. It's too much.

815
42:38.070 --> 42:39.800
Take it. Take it.

816
42:43.810 --> 42:46.440
Fellow villager, please accept it.

817
42:47.280 --> 42:50.120
Money has a price, but kindness is priceless.

818
42:50.920 --> 42:52.720
For seven days and seven nights,

819
42:52.920 --> 42:54.600
you worked tirelessly

820
42:55.030 --> 42:58.110
to help tens of thousands of us cross the Jinsha River.

821
42:58.500 --> 43:01.580
Our Red Army will never forget

822
43:02.030 --> 43:03.680
your kindness!
